{
    "background_story": "Jeremiah was a quirky inventor who lived in a small, chilly apartment in the city. One harsh winter, he found himself struggling to stay warm, despite piling on layers of clothing. Frustrated with the ineffective heating system, Jeremiah decided to take matters into his own hands. He spent countless hours tinkering with an old radiator, determined to create a more efficient and eco-friendly heating solution. After months of trial and error, Jeremiah finally succeeded in designing a revolutionary new radiator that not only warmed his apartment but also helped to reduce energy consumption. His innovative design soon gained attention from environmental organizations and heating companies, and Jeremiah became a celebrated figure in the field of sustainable energy.",
